{
  "name": "Webhook alert to Telegram",
  "meta": {
    "description": "A public webhook URL receives any JSON (a form, a payment tool, a script) and forwards a formatted alert to a Telegram chat, then answers the caller.",
    "categories": [
      "Webhooks",
      "Messaging"
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "wh",
      "name": "Incoming alert",
      "type": "belflow.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "alert-to-telegram",
        "responseMode": "lastNode"
      },
      "webhookId": "alert-to-telegram-template"
    },
    {
      "id": "fmt",
      "name": "Format message",
      "type": "belflow.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        280,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "text",
              "value": "=🔔 {{ $json.body.title || 'New alert' }}\n{{ $json.body.message || JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tg",
      "name": "Send to Telegram",
      "type": "belflow.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "belflow.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -250
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Webhook alert to Telegram\n1. Add a **Telegram** credential (bot token from @BotFather) and set the chat id.\n2. Open **Incoming alert**, copy the test URL and POST `{\"title\":\"Hi\",\"message\":\"It works\"}`.\n3. Activate the workflow to use the production URL.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 190,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Incoming alert": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format message",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format message": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send to Telegram",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {}
}